<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-20259] 'simul not found' reported for many test sessions</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20259</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;It looks like the &lt;tt&gt;simul&lt;/tt&gt; test program (&lt;a href="https://github.com/llnl/simul" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://github.com/llnl/simul&lt;/a&gt;) is not installed on some test nodes/distros, so it is being skipped for a large number of test sessions, including full branch landing test sessions:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/search?horizon=518400&amp;amp;test_set_script_id=b10ed7ea-55b4-11e0-bb3d-52540025f9af&amp;amp;sub_test_script_id=b13fa01e-55b4-11e0-bb3d-52540025f9af&amp;amp;source=sub_tests#redirect" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/search?horizon=518400&amp;amp;test_set_script_id=b10ed7ea-55b4-11e0-bb3d-52540025f9af&amp;amp;sub_test_script_id=b13fa01e-55b4-11e0-bb3d-52540025f9af&amp;amp;source=sub_tests#redirect&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It &lt;em&gt;appears&lt;/em&gt; that this is related to the distro being tested, but it may also be related to specific test images/nodes missing the package.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
